<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="PHM" style="id">Vidunda Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Filimeni</para>
  <para style="toc1">Baluwa ya Paoli kwa Filimeni</para>
  <para style="toc2">Filimeni</para>
  <para style="toc3">File</para>
  <para style="mt2">Baluwa ya Paoli kwa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Filimeni</para>
  <para style="imt">Chilongole</para>
  <para style="ip">Chitabu chidodo cha Filimeni nachandichigwa na Mtumigwa Paoli (Filimeni 1:1). Paoli nayali mchinweng'ho mhela loyandiche chitabu achi, mina hanji nakandika chitabu achi kulawila ako Loma. Wone nayali ako Loma, loyachandiche, leka nachandichigwa kuli mhela wa miyaka makumi sita na imwe kulawila loyavumbuche Yesu Kilistu. Chitabu cha Wakolosai nacho nachandichigwa kuli mhela awo.</para>
  <para style="ip">Paoli nakandika baluwa ayi kwa munhu nayachemigwe Filimeni. Filimeni nayali yumwe wa hewo kuli chilundo cha wanhu walingumkunda Kilistu na kahi nayali na wapogozi wenji. Paoli nakamwandichila baluwa ayi Filimeni leka kumlanda yaleche kumgaza mpogozi wa heye Onesimo nayabilime kulawa kwa Filimeni. Kuli malajizo ga Loma, Filimeni nayali yoweza kumkopola Onesimo. Paoli nayali yolonga kwa kudedeza kumkangaza nhumbula Filimeni yambochele Onesimo kota mng'holoze kuli Kilistu na kumlajila kota Onesimo yakundigwe kumtanza Paoli (Filimeni 1:13-14).</para>
  <para style="iot">Gali mgati</para>
  <para style="io">1. Paoli kangumlamsa Filimeni kuli (Filimeni 1:1-3).</para>
  <para style="io">2. Hamba Paoli kanguuza honhu ha Onesimo kota Filimeni kambochela heye kota mng'holoze kuli Kilistu (Filimeni 1:4-21).</para>
  <para style="io">3. Paoli kangugwisa chilasi kwa kuwalonjela kugana kuwajendela na kuwalamsa (Filimeni 1:22-25).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PHM 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHM 1:1" />Heni Paoli nda mchinweng'ho kwa chiwalo cha kumkolela mijito Kilistu Yesu na Timoteyi mng'holozetu kuli Kilistu, ndangukwandichila hegwe Filimeni tukuganile, mkolamijito myetu, <verse eid="PHM 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHM 1:2" />na lumbulyetu Afiya na mtowa ngondo muyetu Alikipo na wanhu walingumkunda Kilistu, walingiting'hana hakaye hako.<verse eid="PHM 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHM 1:3" />Ndanguwaganilani isungu na kikala goya kulawila kwa Nguluwi Mhaza wa hetwe na kwa Mkulu Yesu Kilistu.<verse eid="PHM 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Igano na makundo ga Filimeni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHM 1:4" />Mhela weng'ha heni hondilanda, ndangukukumbuka hegwe Filimeni na kuta malumbo Nguluwi, <verse eid="PHM 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHM 1:5" />kwa vila ndanguhulika mbuli ya makundo ga hegwe kwa Mkulu Yesu na igano lya hegwe kwa wanhu weng'ha wa Nguluwi. <verse eid="PHM 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHM 1:6" />Ndangulanda makundo ago gouwele nguwalonjela wanhu wanji, gawadahize muwe na uwanzi wenele ng'hatu na utambichizo unojile wotulingupegwa kuli kilumba kwa hetwe na Kilistu. <verse eid="PHM 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHM 1:7" />Mng'holozangu, igano lya hegwe lingalila kusangalala kukulu na kung'hangaza nhumbula ng'hatu! Nagwe kukangaza nhumbula za wanhu wa Nguluwi.<verse eid="PHM 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paoli kangumlanda Filimeni yambochele Onesimo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHM 1:8" />Kwa chiwalo acho, ndahawezile, ne kudumba ng'hatu, londiwa mng'holozo kuli kilumba na Kilistu, kukulajiza udite choulingulapigwa kudita, <verse eid="PHM 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHM 1:9" />ila kwa chiwalo cha igano, ndangona yagoya ng'hatu ndikulande. Ndangudita hino hanga heni nda Paoli, msenga wa Kilistu Yesu na sambi kahi nda mchinweng'ho kwa chiwalo cha kumkolela mijito Yesu Kilistu. <verse eid="PHM 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHM 1:10" />Lelo, ndangulanda umtanze mwana wa heni Onesimo, yawele mwana wa heni kuli kilumba na Kilistu, kwa vila nandiwa kota mhaza wa heye londali mchinweng'ho. <verse eid="PHM 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHM 1:11" />Ndo Onesimo yuyula nayali hambe yawe na utanzi, ila sambi kana utanzi kwa hetwe weng'ha, heni na hegwe kahi.<verse eid="PHM 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHM 1:12" />Sambi ndangumhilusa kwa hegwe, naye ndo ndimganile ng'hatu. <verse eid="PHM 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHM 1:13" />Nangana yekale na heni yanhanze honhu ha hegwe mhela awu mbele mchinweng'ho kwa chiwalo cha kudamla Mbuli Inojile. <verse eid="PHM 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHM 1:14" />Ila siganile kudita chinhu choneche ne kukulonjela hegwe. Kahi nasiganile ne kukukola lupichi unhanze, ila nangana udite kota nhumbula ya hegwe vyoilingugana.<verse eid="PHM 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHM 1:15" />Hanji, Onesimo nakoka kwa hegwe kwa mhela udo hela, leka uwe naye kahi mazuwa gose. <verse eid="PHM 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHM 1:16" />Sambi heye hawele mpogozi wa hihi hela, ila lelo, ayu kapuluta ng'hatu kuupogozi, heye ka mng'holozetu tumganile. Ndo wa kitumbila ng'hatu kwa heni na kwa hegwe, kota chitumagwa na kota mng'holozetu kuli kilumba na Mkulu.<verse eid="PHM 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHM 1:17" />Lelo, wone ulingunzela heni kota nda mng'holozo kuli kilumba na Mkulu, mbochele heye kota vila wali umbochela nene baha. <verse eid="PHM 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHM 1:18" />Wone nayali yakuditile wihe, ama nayali yodaigwa na hegwe, lelo, heni ndokuhilusila. <verse eid="PHM 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHM 1:19" />Ndangwandika mbuli ayi kwa moko gangu nene, heni Paoli ndohilusa! Kahi silingugana kukulonjela kota na hegwe nagwe ndangukudai mbaka ukomu wa hegwe. <verse eid="PHM 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHM 1:20" />Ena, mng'holozangu, unditile mbuli ayo kwa chiwalo cha itagwa lya Mkulu, usangalaze nhumbula ya heni kuli kilumba na Yesu Kilistu.<verse eid="PHM 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHM 1:21" />Ndangwandika ndichitumbila kota kodita achi chondilingukulajiza, kahi ndivizela kota kodita mzidi wa aga gondilikukulanda. <verse eid="PHM 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHM 1:22" />Hamwe na ago mngongomanyile honhu ha kuwasa, mina ndangitumbila kota kwa kulanda kwa hegwe, Nguluwi konhanza ndikujendeleni.<verse eid="PHM 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ulamso wa kugwisa chilasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHM 1:23" />Epafula, mnweng'hwa muyangu yawele mchinweng'ho hamwe na heni kwa chiwalo cha kumkolela mijito Yesu Kilistu, kangukulamsa. <verse eid="PHM 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHM 1:24" />Nawo achina Malichi na Alistako na Dema na Lukasi, wakola mijito wayangu, wangukulamsa. <verse eid="PHM 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHM 1:25" />Ndanguwalandila hemwe isungu lya Mkulu wa hetwe Yesu Kilistu liwe na hemwe mweng'ha.<verse eid="PHM 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHM 1" />
</usx>